    },
    {
      "text": "In a large mixing bowl toss together the green cabbage, celery, white onion, half the chives, and half the blue cheese.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/buffalo-coleslaw/#wprm-recipe-52257-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/buffalo-coleslaw-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the dressing to the cabbage and toss together.",
